OL,3,ATom Cullen says he doesn't take playing
OL,4,ALGBT roles lightly
OL,5,
OL,6,FTom Cullen says he does not take the
OL,7,Fprivilege of playing a gay character
OL,8,Flightly.
OL,10,FSpeaking at the screening of
OL,11,Fmystery-thriller Black Church Bay at
OL,12,Fthe Iris Prize Festival, the Downton
OL,13,FAbbey and House of the Dragon actor
OL,14,Fsaid representation mattered.
OL,16,FIn the film, Cullen, from Aberystwyth,
OL,17,FCeredigion, plays a closeted man who
OL,18,Ffinds he will go to any lengths to keep
OL,19,Fup appearances in his insular
OL,20,Fcommunity.
